Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:55:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(cudafy): enable cudafy conversion for the
 CUDA-compat mode

Restore the cudafy pre-build conversion hooks (flash-attention and
actlize) and the --cudafy-compat CLI in the sailify pipeline, and move
the conversion out of tools/sailify into its own module carrying the
patch set (cutlass platform numeric-limits and arch aliases,
flash-attention namespace config and num-splits guard).
