+# Copyright (c) 2026 Zhejiang Runhe Cloud Intelligence Technology Co., Ltd.
+"""CUDA-compatible (compat) third-party conversion tool.
+
+Converts the PPU third-party forks (flash-attention-for-sail, actlize and
+flex-flash-attention) into CUDA-compilable sources under an out-of-place
+derived tree, applies the compat-owned patch set and fixes the C++ standard
+flags of the generated build files.
+
+This package is the standalone counterpart of ``tools.sailify``: sailify
+owns the SAIL whole-tree conversion, while this package owns the
+CUDA-compatible third-party conversion.  The top-level CMakeLists.txt
+invokes it automatically at configure time for the compat build mode
+(USE_PPU=ON, USE_SAIL=OFF).
+"""
